  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7FSLYtk.png\" alt=\"模拟刀剑横幅\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TDHaFqs.png\" alt=\"尝试模拟技能\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOWyCv6.png\" alt=\"武器变体\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iduZbq5.png\" alt=\"独特武器\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wNQ0qRk.png\" alt=\"模组支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H8BUkyQ.png\" alt=\"更好战斗支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WfWziAG.png\" alt=\"Patchouli 支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hHoFbQt.png\" alt=\"额外支持\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n4a4oE0.png\" alt=\"Knaves Needs 附加包\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kZgkBV3.gif\" alt=\"Simply More 附加包\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9OPf1J.png\" alt=\"需要 Architectury 和 Cloth Config\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>额外内置支持</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>额外附加支持</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">禁忌与秘术 | 暮色森林 | 地下花园 | 蓝天 | 以及末地<br>通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knaves Needs</a>（由 KodoDenka 制作）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-more\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply More</a>（由 Rosemary__Thyme 制作）添加 10 种以上武器类型和 26 件以上独特武器</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">更喜欢另一种外观？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simply-swords-classic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模拟刀剑经典版（旧版 3D 模型）</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/yourscraft/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yourscraft 资源包 + 模拟刀剑扩展</a>（由 Manos_Of_Fate 制作）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/armaments-of-legend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传说武备资源包</a>（由 Count_Sjorn_Paradox 制作）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">其他 Timefall Development 模组</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-steak\" rel=\"nofollow\">金牛排</a>&nbsp;- 添加金牛排和附魔金牛排<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 地下城武器</a>&nbsp;- 将 Minecraft 地下城的武器带入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdar\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 地下城神器</a>&nbsp;- 将 Minecraft 地下城的神器带入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 地下城盔甲</a> - 将 Minecraft 地下城的盔甲带入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsa\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 故事模式盔甲</a>&nbsp;- 将 Minecraft 故事模式的盔甲套装带入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/save-gear-on-death\" rel=\"nofollow\">死亡保留装备</a>&nbsp;- 在保留物品栏和不保留之间取得平衡<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/headshot-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">爆头 [Forge 版]</a>&nbsp;- 允许玩家和部分生物被爆头<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-summoning\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物召唤</a>&nbsp;- 召唤生物与你并肩作战<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamond-shards-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">钻石碎片</a>&nbsp;- 将钻石打碎成九个碎片，非常适合基于钻石的经济体系<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">战利品配置</a>&nbsp;- 全面自定义 Minecraft 的战利品表<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/interchangeable\" rel=\"nofollow\">可互换</a>&nbsp;- 用于根据配置互换合成配方的 Minecraft 模组</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模拟技能</a> - 一款为 Fabric 打造的综合技能树模组</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>想在服务器上与朋友一起玩模拟刀剑吗？不妨考虑使用 BisectHosting 的服务器？它们已经准备就绪，可以直接开玩！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fTimefall\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/9deaa8f0-11c2-41f1-8f4f-32d2493b0912.png\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/tRUdaHx7gG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1020119045925773382?color=5865f2&amp;label= &amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://discord.gg/tRUdaHx7gG\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsweenus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_dark.png\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"151\" height=\"57\"></a></p>",
